// Title: Sysmon Configuration Error
// ID: 815cd91b-7dbc-4247-841a-d7dd1392b0a8
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-06-04
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564
// Description: Detects when an adversary is trying to hide it's action from Sysmon logging based on error messages
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (((Description like "*_Failed to open service configuration with error*" or Description like "*_Failed to connect to the driver to update configuration*")) and not ((((Description like "*_Failed to open service configuration with error 19*" or Description like "*_Failed to open service configuration with error 93*")) or ((Description like "*_Failed to open service configuration with error*" and Description like "*_Last error: The media is write protected.*")) or ((Description like "*_Failed to open service configuration with error*" and Description like "*_Last error: Média protégé en écriture.*")))))
